				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：WHITEver
・はい/いいえ選択肢表示
・はい→badrider_05
　はい、だけど戦闘可能ポケモン2匹以下→badrider_06
　いいえ→badrider_07</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</CommentCell>
